WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
The Qur'an names other
holy books: the Torah,

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.410
the Psalms and the Gospel.

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.560
Muslims believe God gave them
to Moses, David and Jesus.

4
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.170
The Qur'an even calls the Torah and
the Gospel guidance and a light.

5
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.700
So belief in God's books
is part of Muslim faith.

6
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.320
Yet Muslims follow only the Qur'an.

7
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.320
Why?

8
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.840
In this mission, you'll match
five books to five messengers,

9
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.840
from Abraham to Muhammad.

10
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.330
Then you'll explore how Muslims
see the earlier books today,

11
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.740
and weigh up whether they still matter.

12
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.580
Your mission: find out why
Muslims, who honour these books,

13
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.270
follow only the Qur'an.
